# Wave W17-U (Route 201): mile post — a mile post on the professor’s thinking walk: a plain post carrying one pale mileage band and a small lake-blue notch under it, the Candor glint cut into the wood (design: mile posts along the thinking-walk grass where the professor’s walks cross the north grass). On candor turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — split from the fleet’s marker posts by the blue notch: this post measures the first road out of Clover.
